    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf4e Apple Pop! \u2013 It\u2019s a Puzzle Thing.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable and heartwarming number puzzle game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag the apples, make 10,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and build your very own healing apple island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832410/extras/598bd8bcd80638279834d522998d8567.poster.avif?t=1751248083\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832410/extras/598bd8bcd80638279834d522998d8567.webp?t=1751248083\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832410/extras/eda3c44e403387327ee7920074b8a90f.poster.avif?t=1751248083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832410/extras/eda3c44e403387327ee7920074b8a90f.webm?t=1751248083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832410/extras/eda3c44e403387327ee7920074b8a90f.mp4?t=1751248083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Apple Pop!, the rising puzzle sensation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag apples with numbers \u2014 if they add up to 10, they go POP! \ud83c\udf4f\ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules, but clever strategy and quick thinking are key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a perfect mix of brain training, addictive gameplay, and healing vibes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the satisfying pop at your fingertips,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collect shells, unlock new areas, and decorate your cozy apple island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you start, it\u2019s hard to stop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your focus, ease your stress,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and relax as you pop your way to peace. \ud83c\udf34</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start popping now! \ud83c\udf4e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832410/extras/90ba63a40b06fa5e27dbe7c2a4cf3e6d.poster.webp?t=1751248083\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832410/extras/90ba63a40b06fa5e27dbe7c2a4cf3e6d.webp?t=1751248083\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6 Strategic &amp; Satisfying Puzzle Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Drag apples to make 10 \u2013 and watch them POP!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Fast decisions and sharp thinking are the key!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Easy to learn, hard to master \u2014 fun for everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6 Solo Mode &amp; Real-Time PvP Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Play at your own pace in the healing solo mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Or challenge friends and global players in real-time PvP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Win matches, unlock new zones, and grow your island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832410/extras/71ad0cd8c90853e8f359950e3ce0eba1.poster.avif?t=1751248083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832410/extras/71ad0cd8c90853e8f359950e3ce0eba1.webm?t=1751248083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832410/extras/71ad0cd8c90853e8f359950e3ce0eba1.mp4?t=1751248083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6 Build Your Own Healing Island</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Collect shells to expand and decorate your island</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Unlock various cute and cozy objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A relaxing customization experience full of charm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832410/extras/87cd430876741647c8fea18b342bd151.poster.avif?t=1751248083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832410/extras/87cd430876741647c8fea18b342bd151.webm?t=1751248083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832410/extras/87cd430876741647c8fea18b342bd151.mp4?t=1751248083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca1 Perfect For Those Who...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Love puzzles that train your brain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Enjoy cute and minimal number-based games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Want both relaxation and excitement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Like collecting and decorating with purpose</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Are looking for a feel-good, satisfying mobile game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic